## Uploaded applicant CVs / scan temp files — personal data, never committed
**/App_Data/careers/
**/App_Data/scan-temp/

## Runtime marker written by ClamAvBootstrapService to throttle failed install retries
**/App_Data/clamav-install-failed.marker

## Cms-uploaded content (page images, menu PDF) — runtime uploads, not source.
## The folders themselves stay tracked (via .gitkeep) since the app writes into them at their
## existing path; only what gets uploaded into them is ignored.
**/wwwroot/img/cms/*
!**/wwwroot/img/cms/.gitkeep
**/wwwroot/pdf/cms/*
!**/wwwroot/pdf/cms/.gitkeep

## Local build artifacts staged for deployment (dotnet publish output, migration scripts)
artifacts/
